(===== README.md =====) Tj
T*
(# Manish Mishra Academy \(MMA\)) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Full-stack coaching academy website with public content, role-based portals, academic resources, fee management,) Tj
T*
( and Razorpay-ready sandbox payments.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(## Requirements) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(- Node.js 20 LTS or newer) Tj
T*
(- npm 10 or newer) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(## Technology) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(- Frontend: React, Vite, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, React Router) Tj
T*
(- Backend: Node.js, Express, TypeScript, Zod) Tj
T*
(- Database: SQLite with Prisma ORM) Tj
T*
(- Authentication: JWT in HTTP-only cookie, backend role and permission checks) Tj
T*
(- Payments: Razorpay REST API and signed webhook verification) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(## Installation) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(npm install) Tj
T*
(npm --prefix client install) Tj
T*
(npm --prefix server install) Tj
T*
(copy .env.example .env) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Never commit `.env`, payment secrets, private uploads, or local database files.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(## Environment) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Set these values in the root `.env`:) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(```env) Tj
T*
(PORT=4000) Tj
T*
(CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:5173) Tj
T*
(DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db") Tj
T*
(JWT_SECRET=use-a-long-random-secret) Tj
T*
(ADMIN_EMAIL=replace-with-admin-email) Tj
T*
(ADMIN_PASSWORD=replace-with-admin-password) Tj
T*
(PAYMENT_KEY_ID=) Tj
T*
(PAYMENT_KEY_SECRET=) Tj
T*
(PAYMENT_WEBHOOK_SECRET=) Tj
T*
(PAYMENT_SANDBOX=true) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Payment secrets are read only by the server and are never sent to the frontend.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(## Database) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(npm run db:generate) Tj
T*
(npm run db:push) Tj
T*
(npm run db:seed) Tj
T*
(npm --prefix server exec tsx -- prisma/seed-part2.ts) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(For a clean local development database only:) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(npm --prefix server exec prisma db push -- --force-reset) Tj
ET
