T*
( ) Tj
T*
(## Development) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(npm run dev) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(- Frontend: http://localhost:5173) Tj
T*
(- Backend: http://localhost:4000) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(## Production) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(npm run build) Tj
T*
(npm --prefix server start) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Configure HTTPS, a production database, secure cookies, and real Razorpay webhook settings before launch.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(## Authentication and authorization) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Roles are `HEAD`, `SUPERVISOR`, `TEACHER`, and `STUDENT`. There is no public student or teacher registration. Th) Tj
T*
(e backend enforces record ownership, teacher class/subject assignments, student enrollments, and supervisor perm) Tj
T*
(issions.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(## Payment) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(Set Razorpay test credentials in `.env` and keep `PAYMENT_SANDBOX=true` during development. The backend verifies) Tj
T*
( payment signatures and webhooks, uses transactions for balance updates, prevents overpayment, and creates recei) Tj
T*
(pts only for verified successful payments. The no-credential development mode creates internal sandbox orders fo) Tj
T*
(r workflow testing; it is not a real payment gateway.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(## Testing) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(npm --prefix server exec tsc -- -p tsconfig.json) Tj
T*
(npm --prefix client exec tsc -- -b tsconfig.app.json) Tj
T*
(npm run build) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(The security checks cover invalid signatures, failed payments, duplicate verification, student fee privacy, teac) Tj
T*
(her assignment restrictions, private downloads, and supervisor payment permission denial.) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(## Real MMA information still required) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(- Official address, phone, email, and WhatsApp details) Tj
T*
(- Approved logo and brand assets) Tj
T*
(- Real faculty names and assignments) Tj
T*
(- Actual subjects, batches, timetable, and photographs) Tj
T*
(- Approved fee structures and policies) Tj
T*
(- Production Razorpay account and webhook URL) Tj
T*
(- Privacy, refund, cancellation, and terms policies) Tj
T*
(- Production domain for canonical URLs and sitemap entries) Tj
T*
( ) Tj
T*
(===== .env.example =====) Tj
T*
(PORT=4000) Tj
ET
